# High-resolution texture tiers (4K/8K, ~130 MB).
# Kept out of git so clones stay small; the simulator falls back to the 2K maps,
# which are tracked. Re-add a file here (or fetch it yourself) to get the
# close-approach detail back — see textures/CREDITS.md for the sources.
textures/4k_*
textures/8k_*

# Browsers cannot decode TIFF; these are source material only.
textures/*.tif

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Local scratch
node_modules/
.cache/
